{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harem of Ankhutep</strong> is a visual novel set in the ancient city of Ankhutep, an oasis in the desert where daily life unfolds in the shadow of gods, and monstergirls walk the streets as a natural part of everyday life. You travel to Ankhutep to forge a new life, not as a warrior or a ruler, but as a humble craftsman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/d07753a5d5c6ea2d7e7721c0e24fab87.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you\u2019ll share meals, trade stories, and slowly carve out a new life surrounded by friendship, romance, and small, meaningful moments.\u00a0Yet beneath the city\u2019s warmth lie quiet mysteries, and every bond you form may open the door to ancient secrets waiting just out of sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/9fa8c2b8c6e03ce5c2347c74d9c6b489.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=146 /></span>Carve out a new life surrounded by friendship, romance, and small, meaningful moments.\u00a0Yet beneath the city\u2019s warmth lie hidden mysteries, and every bond you form may open the door to ancient secrets waiting just out of sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/eba7d03fd06ae38a2f72d303abb2ec42.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a\u00a0diverse cast of monstergirl heroines, each with her own unique personality, ambition, and desire. Your decisions shape your path, unlock new events, and reveal different sides of the story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Egypt setting</strong>: Explore a city of temples, palaces, and hidden springs brought to life with rich detail.\u00a0Hand-crafted 3D art creates\u200b a unique and compelling Egypt-inspired atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster girls</strong>: Meet crocodile-, mushroom-, Anubis-\u200b,\u00a0lion-girls, and more, each with her own personality, charm, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Story-Driven Encounters:</strong> Sensual scenes woven into meaningful relationships, fully animated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery </strong> \u2013 Discover secrets, uncover intrigue, and see different sides of Ankhutep depending on the choices you make<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong>: Shape your relationships and reveal different sides of Ankhutep with each choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/60c2abae21918f932067a53927a3cdf5.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tamun admires strength and confidence, but she\u2019s just as fond of good wine and good company. Spend enough time with her, and you may find her bite isn\u2019t nearly as dangerous as her charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/bf8edce650ecc337b1fe258c13fee17a.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raa speaks rarely, but when she does, her words linger. With a gaze that seems to see more than she says, she carries an air of mystery that can be both soothing and unsettling. Getting close to her means learning to listen between the silences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/e5597503f55d69122a9b96fd8aa3efcd.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not always the sharpest thinker, but her heart is in the right place. Thalobek tends to leap before she looks, and sadly she also does not always have the best ideas. But her enthusiasm tend to lead to her coming out on top either way, and\u00a0what she lacks in brains, she makes up for with courage and a grin full of sharp teeth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/507dc1d11e9c38d7ebd0825c317c0eb2.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amanita lives quietly with her sisters in the shade of the caves. She\u2019s a kind soul, but her dreamlike manner makes her feel almost otherworldly. She\u2019ll happily share her food and wisdom if you can get used to her unusual ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/d107f903c5ad4267dc1edd6f010b8c30.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A royal figure whose every gesture feels intentional. She listens more than she speaks, and when she does, her words land with quiet weight. There\u2019s warmth in her presence, unmistakable to anyone patient enough\u00a0to see past the crown she never truly asked to wear.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/74775baab18c99abfaad0e01ed8f1c71.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selunara struggles with bright light and even brighter people. She trusts easily, and follows with unwavering loyalty. Soft-spoken and sensitive, she\u2019s still learning how to feel safe in a world much larger than her.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/2812f69b850fbaa7ee97cc8604aef692.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resilient and determined, Darius is a traveler shaped by hardship and driven by a sense of destiny. Though burdened by the weight of past losses, his compassion and loyalty make him a natural protector to those he cares about. His journey is as much about self-discovery as it is about survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014730?t=1767744634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/948b7ca2fa8355490a386d75409d6d21c82f9023/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767744634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/32d1fe69661e235513060621eb88fd76802e601b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767744634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/32d1fe69661e235513060621eb88fd76802e601b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767744634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Contains depictions of consensual sexual acts, frequent nudity and occasional depictions of violence (no gore)."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4048610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harem of Ankhutep</strong> is a visual novel set in the ancient city of Ankhutep, an oasis in the desert where daily life unfolds in the shadow of gods, and monstergirls walk the streets as a natural part of everyday life. You travel to Ankhutep to forge a new life, not as a warrior or a ruler, but as a humble craftsman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/d07753a5d5c6ea2d7e7721c0e24fab87.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you\u2019ll share meals, trade stories, and slowly carve out a new life surrounded by friendship, romance, and small, meaningful moments.\u00a0Yet beneath the city\u2019s warmth lie quiet mysteries, and every bond you form may open the door to ancient secrets waiting just out of sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/9fa8c2b8c6e03ce5c2347c74d9c6b489.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=146 /></span>Carve out a new life surrounded by friendship, romance, and small, meaningful moments.\u00a0Yet beneath the city\u2019s warmth lie hidden mysteries, and every bond you form may open the door to ancient secrets waiting just out of sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/eba7d03fd06ae38a2f72d303abb2ec42.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a\u00a0diverse cast of monstergirl heroines, each with her own unique personality, ambition, and desire. Your decisions shape your path, unlock new events, and reveal different sides of the story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Egypt setting</strong>: Explore a city of temples, palaces, and hidden springs brought to life with rich detail.\u00a0Hand-crafted 3D art creates\u200b a unique and compelling Egypt-inspired atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster girls</strong>: Meet crocodile-, mushroom-, Anubis-\u200b,\u00a0lion-girls, and more, each with her own personality, charm, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Story-Driven Encounters:</strong> Sensual scenes woven into meaningful relationships, fully animated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery </strong> \u2013 Discover secrets, uncover intrigue, and see different sides of Ankhutep depending on the choices you make<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong>: Shape your relationships and reveal different sides of Ankhutep with each choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/60c2abae21918f932067a53927a3cdf5.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tamun admires strength and confidence, but she\u2019s just as fond of good wine and good company. Spend enough time with her, and you may find her bite isn\u2019t nearly as dangerous as her charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/bf8edce650ecc337b1fe258c13fee17a.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raa speaks rarely, but when she does, her words linger. With a gaze that seems to see more than she says, she carries an air of mystery that can be both soothing and unsettling. Getting close to her means learning to listen between the silences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/e5597503f55d69122a9b96fd8aa3efcd.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not always the sharpest thinker, but her heart is in the right place. Thalobek tends to leap before she looks, and sadly she also does not always have the best ideas. But her enthusiasm tend to lead to her coming out on top either way, and\u00a0what she lacks in brains, she makes up for with courage and a grin full of sharp teeth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/507dc1d11e9c38d7ebd0825c317c0eb2.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amanita lives quietly with her sisters in the shade of the caves. She\u2019s a kind soul, but her dreamlike manner makes her feel almost otherworldly. She\u2019ll happily share her food and wisdom if you can get used to her unusual ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/d107f903c5ad4267dc1edd6f010b8c30.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A royal figure whose every gesture feels intentional. She listens more than she speaks, and when she does, her words land with quiet weight. There\u2019s warmth in her presence, unmistakable to anyone patient enough\u00a0to see past the crown she never truly asked to wear.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/74775baab18c99abfaad0e01ed8f1c71.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selunara struggles with bright light and even brighter people. She trusts easily, and follows with unwavering loyalty. Soft-spoken and sensitive, she\u2019s still learning how to feel safe in a world much larger than her.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/extras/2812f69b850fbaa7ee97cc8604aef692.avif?t=1767744634\" width=1080 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resilient and determined, Darius is a traveler shaped by hardship and driven by a sense of destiny. Though burdened by the weight of past losses, his compassion and loyalty make him a natural protector to those he cares about. His journey is as much about self-discovery as it is about survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AhaNubis"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014730/d9fd68b4028308a3c195c63f67babc9d72eee1e8/header.jpg?t=1767744634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4014730/352183211/cafddf831cfd4d9edb6d654d54e97185424e0156/1758249254/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758250474","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4014730/352183211/cafddf831cfd4d9edb6d654d54e97185424e0156/1758249254/dash_h264.mpd?t